<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for May</p>
<p>9-12. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	    May 9-12	 May 8/9</p>
<p> CZK	0.4451	  0.44785</p>
<p> DKK	2.10153	 2.10083</p>
<p> FIM	2.6472	  2.65463</p>
<p> HUF	0.7533	  0.07548</p>
<p> JPY	0.11107	 0.11062</p>
<p> LTL	3.4079	  3.4254</p>
<p> LVL     23.6557	 23.69289</p>
<p> RUR	0.00237	 0.00238</p>
<p> SEK	1.77417	 1.77521</p>
<p> UAH	7.42664	 7.50567</p>
<p> USD     13.6316	 13.7016</p>
<p> XEU     15.56388	15.57666</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
